; Fixture: mid-file g-code state manipulation.
; Exercises: G92 (partial and bare), M220 speed factor, M221 extrude
; factor, SET_GCODE_OFFSET (absolute, _ADJUST, and MOVE=1 forms),
; SAVE_GCODE_STATE / RESTORE_GCODE_STATE with MOVE=1, M204 P/T form.
G90
M82
G92 E0
G1 X10 Y10 Z0.2 F6000
G1 X30 Y10 E1.0 F1800
M220 S150
G1 X30 Y30 E2.0
M221 S95
G1 X10 Y30 E3.0
G92 E0
G1 X10 Y10 E1.0
SET_GCODE_OFFSET Z=0.05
G1 Z0.25 F7200
SET_GCODE_OFFSET Z_ADJUST=-0.05
G1 Z0.2
SET_GCODE_OFFSET X=1 Y=1 MOVE=1 MOVE_SPEED=40
SAVE_GCODE_STATE NAME=fixture
G91
M83
M220 S80
G1 X5 E0.5 F2400
G1 Y5 E0.5
RESTORE_GCODE_STATE NAME=fixture MOVE=1 MOVE_SPEED=60
M204 P4000 T6000
G1 X20 Y20 E2.0 F3000
G92
G1 X-2 Y0 E0.4
M220 S100
M221 S100
G1 X0 Y0 E0.8
